From d51276ca18226e5bd25ab29b68ac4f2543967e74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler South <tsouth2@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:43:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Offer alpha dmabuf formats on the QEMU display

Hyprland 0.57 turned on quirks:skip_non_kms_dmabuf_formats by default. Virtio GPU scans out only XRGB8888, so clients were offered nothing else, Mesa dropped alpha, and full-screen transparent layers such as notifications covered the desktop in black on GPU rendering. The QEMU profile turns the quirk off, as Hyprland 0.56 had it. Revision 64 delivers the profile to existing disks.
---
